; English texts of the installer (bundle.windows.nsis.customLanguageFiles).
; They replace Tauri's own file, so every key Tauri's template uses must be here:
; after a Tauri update, compare with target/release/nsis/x64/English.nsh.
; kmWelcome* are ours (installer-hooks.nsh). Plain words, no technical terms.
LangString addOrReinstall ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Install again"
LangString alreadyInstalled ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Already installed"
LangString alreadyInstalledLong ${LANG_ENGLISH} "${PRODUCTNAME} ${VERSION} is already installed on this computer. Choose what you want to do and click Next."
LangString appRunning ${LANG_ENGLISH} "${PRODUCTNAME} is open. Close it first, then try again."
LangString appRunningOkKill ${LANG_ENGLISH} "${PRODUCTNAME} is open.$\nClick OK to close it."
LangString chooseMaintenanceOption ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Choose what you want to do."
LangString chooseHowToInstall ${LANG_ENGLISH} "How should ${PRODUCTNAME} be installed?"
LangString createDesktop ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Put a shortcut on the desktop"
LangString dontUninstall ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Continue without uninstalling"
LangString dontUninstallDowngrade ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Continue without uninstalling (to install an older version, uninstall the newer one first)"
LangString failedToKillApp ${LANG_ENGLISH} "${PRODUCTNAME} could not be closed. Close it yourself, then try again."
LangString installingWebview2 ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Installing a required Windows component (WebView2)..."
LangString newerVersionInstalled ${LANG_ENGLISH} "A newer version of ${PRODUCTNAME} is installed on this computer. Installing an older one is not recommended; if you really want to, uninstall the newer version first. Choose what you want to do and click Next."
LangString older ${LANG_ENGLISH} "older"
LangString olderOrUnknownVersionInstalled ${LANG_ENGLISH} "An $R4 version of ${PRODUCTNAME} is installed on this computer. It is best to uninstall it before installing. Choose what you want to do and click Next."
LangString silentDowngrades ${LANG_ENGLISH} "An older version cannot be installed silently with this installer. Open the installer by double-clicking it.$\n"
LangString unableToUninstall ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Could not uninstall."
LangString uninstallApp ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Uninstall ${PRODUCTNAME}"
LangString uninstallBeforeInstalling ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Uninstall before installing"
LangString unknown ${LANG_ENGLISH} "unknown"
LangString webview2AbortError ${LANG_ENGLISH} "A required Windows component (WebView2) could not be installed, and the app cannot run without it. Try starting the installer again."
LangString webview2DownloadError ${LANG_ENGLISH} "A required Windows component (WebView2) could not be downloaded: $0"
LangString webview2DownloadSuccess ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Required Windows component downloaded"
LangString webview2Downloading ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Downloading a required Windows component (WebView2)..."
LangString webview2InstallError ${LANG_ENGLISH} "A required Windows component (WebView2) could not be installed (error code $1)."
LangString webview2InstallSuccess ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Required Windows component installed"
LangString deleteAppData ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Also delete my settings and saved data"
LangString kmWelcomeTitle ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Welcome to the ${PRODUCTNAME} setup"
LangString kmWelcomeText ${LANG_ENGLISH} "${PRODUCTNAME} lets you control your keyboard's lighting, keys and screen.$\r$\n$\r$\nIt installs for your account only, needs no administrator rights and takes a few seconds.$\r$\n$\r$\nClick Next to continue."
